<title>FINLAND: Rautaruukki 4-mth sales, profit breakdown.</title>
<headline>Rautaruukki 4-mth sales, profit breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish steel group Rautaruukki on Wednesday gave the following operating profit and net sales breakdown by division (million markka):</p>
<p>    OPERATING PROFIT	     Jan-April	    Jan-April '96</p>
<p> Raahe steel			    156		    315</p>
<p> Strip products			 147		    117</p>
<p> Metform				   50		     63</p>
<p> Steel structure division	     2		     -9</p>
<p> Engineering division		 -33		     -7</p>
<p> Fundia				    15		     37</p>
<p> Keskometalli and CCB Stal	   18			9</p>
<p> Other units and internal items    42		    -21</p>
<p> TOTAL				    397		    504</p>
<p>NET SALES</p>
<p> Raahe steel			  1,528		   1,630</p>
<p> Strip products		     1,007		   1,004</p>
<p> Metform				  675		     691</p>
<p> Steel structure division	   305		     286</p>
<p> Engineering division		  77		     146</p>
<p> Fundia				 1,348		   1,377</p>
<p> Keskometalli and CCB Stal	  477		     161</p>
<p>Other units less internal</p>
<p> invoicing			   -1,074		    -970</p>
<p> TOTAL				  4,344		   4,325</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuter.fi</p>
